 "description": "$0.01 per call. Use when you need one bounded answer for ONE pump.fun mint you are about to buy or hold, plus a free signed card page (share_url) anyone can open: avoid | caution | no_flags_observed by the fixed public rule (/v1/labels), a one-line reason, up to three observed flags with evidence, P(rug within 5 min), P(true graduation), market, authorities and the cohorts block (dev, bundlers, snipers, top holders; context, the rule does not read it). Raw evidence: check_pumpfun_risk. Input: mint (a mint or a pump.fun/gmgn/solscan/birdeye link). Needs full live coverage and feed lag <= 5 s (uncovered, stale or a curve not quoted in SOL: refused before payment, nothing charged). no_flags_observed is not a safety guarantee. Retrying the exact signed payment within 10 min replays the result, no new settlement.",
